§§§ `8.1.6.2 אש"ל`

@ref akn:chp_8__sec_8_1__ssec_8_1_6_2/p1
GIVEN `civil-service per-diem for the guidance work` IS A NUMBER @desc the per-diem expenses at the rates customary for state employees; an input
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `guide's per-diem expenses` `civil-service per-diem for the guidance work` IS
    `civil-service per-diem for the guidance work`

-- akn:chp_8__sec_8_1__ssec_8_1_6_2/p2 Heading of the source list (אסמכתא).
-- akn:chp_8__sec_8_1__ssec_8_1_6_2/p3 Source: a director-general's circular.

§§§ `8.1.6.3 רכב`

-- In special cases, by criteria to be set, the possibility of a kilometre
-- quota under private-car terms is examined: a permission, not a right.
@ref akn:chp_8__sec_8_1__ssec_8_1_6_3__para_1
GIVETH A DEONTIC `8.1 party` `8.1 action`
DECIDE `a kilometre quota may be examined` IS
    PARTY `a takanon party` `the Ministry of Education`
    MAY   `examine a kilometre quota`
    WITHIN 12

@ref akn:chp_8__sec_8_1__ssec_8_1_6_3__para_2
GIVEN `owns a car` IS A BOOLEAN, `paid by a set quota` IS A BOOLEAN,
      `global-payment tariff per kilometre` IS A NUMBER @desc the "global payment" tariff; an input
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `guide's monthly car payment` `owns a car` `paid by a set quota` `global-payment tariff per kilometre` IS
    IF `owns a car` AND NOT `paid by a set quota`
    THEN 200 TIMES `global-payment tariff per kilometre`
    ELSE 0

-- akn:chp_8__sec_8_1__ssec_8_1_6_3/p1 Heading of the source list (אסמכתא).
-- akn:chp_8__sec_8_1__ssec_8_1_6_3/p2 Source: a director-general's circular.
-- akn:chp_8__sec_8_1__ssec_8_1_6_3/p3 Source: a special director-general's circular.

§§§ `8.1.6.4 גמול טלפונים`

-- akn:chp_8__sec_8_1__ssec_8_1_6_4/p1 Effective date of the section (from 1.4.2000); the file encodes the rule in force and carries no dates.

-- On top of the telephone allowance all teachers receive, an amount by the
-- days of guidance (in shekels a month).
@ref akn:chp_8__sec_8_1__ssec_8_1_6_4__para_1 akn:chp_8__sec_8_1__ssec_8_1_6_4__para_1/p2 akn:chp_8__sec_8_1__ssec_8_1_6_4__para_1/p3 akn:chp_8__sec_8_1__ssec_8_1_6_4__para_1/p4 akn:chp_8__sec_8_1__ssec_8_1_6_4__para_1/p5 akn:chp_8__sec_8_1__ssec_8_1_6_4__para_1/p6
GIVEN days IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `guide's additional telephone amount` days IS
    BRANCH IF days AT LEAST 4 THEN 36.45
           IF days EQUALS 3   THEN 23
           IF days EQUALS 2   THEN 12.15
           IF days EQUALS 1   THEN 7.29
           OTHERWISE 0

-- A 50% addition on calls for a guide living where every call is long-distance.
@ref akn:chp_8__sec_8_1__ssec_8_1_6_4__para_2
GIVEN `long-distance call charges` IS A NUMBER, `every call from home is long-distance` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `long-distance addition` `long-distance call charges` `every call from home is long-distance` IS
    IF `every call from home is long-distance`
    THEN 0.5 TIMES `long-distance call charges`
    ELSE 0

@ref akn:chp_8__sec_8_1__ssec_8_1_6_4__para_3
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `any earlier telephone arrangement for guides still applies` IS FALSE

-- akn:chp_8__sec_8_1__ssec_8_1_6_4/p2 Heading of the source list (אסמכתא).
-- akn:chp_8__sec_8_1__ssec_8_1_6_4/p3 Source: a director-general's circular.
-- akn:chp_8__sec_8_1__ssec_8_1_6_4/p4 Source: a director-general's circular.
-- akn:chp_8__sec_8_1__ssec_8_1_6_4/p5 Source: an accountant-general's circular.

§§§ `8.1.6.5 גמול לגננות בתפקיד הדרכה`

@desc A kindergarten teacher with a kindergarten-coordination allowance who is appointed to a guidance role.
DECLARE `kindergarten guide` HAS
    `kindergarten coordination allowance` IS A NUMBER @desc the allowance she held before the appointment; an input
    `guidance allowance`                  IS A NUMBER @desc the guidance allowance of a teacher in a guidance role; an input
    `years in the role full-time before retiring` IS A NUMBER

@ref akn:chp_8__sec_8_1__ssec_8_1_6_5__para_1
GIVEN k IS A `kindergarten guide`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the difference` k IS
    max 0 (k's `guidance allowance` MINUS k's `kindergarten coordination allowance`)

@ref akn:chp_8__sec_8_1__ssec_8_1_6_5__para_1
GIVEN k IS A `kindergarten guide`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `kindergarten guide's allowances` k IS
    k's `kindergarten coordination allowance` PLUS `the difference` k

@ref akn:chp_8__sec_8_1__ssec_8_1_6_5__para_2
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `guidance years count as management seniority for the coordination allowance` IS TRUE

-- The difference is a temporary supplement for actually holding the role,
-- not counted for severance, pension or retirement benefits — except for a
-- full-time guide of at least 2 years before retiring, for pension.
@ref akn:chp_8__sec_8_1__ssec_8_1_6_5__para_3 akn:chp_8__sec_8_1__ssec_8_1_6_5__para_4
GIVEN k IS A `kindergarten guide`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the difference counts in the pension salary` k IF
    k's `years in the role full-time before retiring` AT LEAST 2

@ref akn:chp_8__sec_8_1__ssec_8_1_6_5__para_3
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the difference counts for severance or retirement benefits` IS FALSE

-- akn:chp_8__sec_8_1__ssec_8_1_6_5/p1 Heading of the source list (אסמכתא).
-- akn:chp_8__sec_8_1__ssec_8_1_6_5/p2 Source: a director-general's circular.
-- akn:chp_8__sec_8_1__ssec_8_1_6_5/p3 Source: collective agreement of 19.9.94.

-- Examples. Salaries and rates are placeholders.
#ASSERT `guidance allowance` `a guide with a degree and five years` EQUALS 2150
#ASSERT `position share for guidance days` 3 EQUALS 0.5
#ASSERT `guide's additional telephone amount` 5 EQUALS 36.45
#ASSERT `kindergarten guide's allowances` (`kindergarten guide` WITH `kindergarten coordination allowance` IS 1000, `guidance allowance` IS 1500, `years in the role full-time before retiring` IS 1) EQUALS 1500

#TRACE `the guide keeps teaching` `ordinary guidance` AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `a takanon party` `the teaching employee` DOES `teach in a school` 2 AT 1
#TRACE `the guide keeps teaching` `ordinary guidance` AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `a takanon party` `the teaching employee` DOES `teach in a school` 1 AT 1
#TRACE `use the leave by 31 August` 1 AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `a takanon party` `the teaching employee` DOES `use the annual leave` 26 AT 11
